WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.310
OP sequence

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:10.840
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:07.430
I never knew there was such a fabulous salon in the academy!

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:13.150
Salon de Marie is managed by our high school's student council.

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:16.860
closed captions

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:18.300
The sweets here are all made by skilled students from the high school.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:21.270
Ah... I see.

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:23.330
A-Amano...

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:27.630
I can't eat another bite.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:28.970
Ichigo-chan?

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:30.720
Have you eaten all of it already?

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.340
Come to speak of it, don't stack the plates up.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:33.690
Are you taking this as a conveyor sweets shop?

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:37.500
You're right. A girl shouldn't have such a pleased expression after eating.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:38.890
You're overeating. You'll get fat.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.080
Shut up.

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:43.450
They say that there's a separate stomach for cakes, right?

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:49.430
She's gorgeous.

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:51.900
Who is she?

00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:58.850
Ah, she's the student council president from the high school, Tennouji Marie-san.

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:05.500
She's a genius who has won many competitions, a favourite student of Henri-sensei.

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:08.990
Tennouji Marie-san.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:20.140
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:20.140
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

